#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:1
msgid "PD Disaggregation"
msgstr "PD 分离（PD Disaggregation）"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:3
msgid ""
"The Disaggregation of Prefill and Decode (PD Disaggregation) has "
"basically become a consensus solution for the deployment of large-scale "
"inference clusters, and its advantages are even more prominent, "
"especially for Mixture of Experts (MOE) models. PD Disaggregation mainly "
"includes three core components: **independent deployment strategies for "
"Prefill and Decode**, **KV cache storage and transmission strategies**, "
"and **scheduling strategies**. Notably, the scheduling strategy is "
"dependent on the KV cache storage and transmission strategy. The PD "
"Disaggregation design in UCM focuses primarily on optimizing KV cache "
"storage and transmission, thereby enabling more rational scheduling "
"strategies."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 与 Decode 的分离（PD Disaggregation）基本上已成为大规模推理集群部署"
"的共识方案，其优势尤其体现在混合专家（Mixture of Experts，MOE）模型上。PD "
"分离主要包括三个核心组件：**Prefill 和 Decode 的独立部署策略**、**KV 缓存存"
"储与传输策略**以及**调度策略**。值得注意的是，调度策略依赖于 KV 缓存存储与"
"传输策略。UCM 中的 PD 分离设计主要着眼于优化 KV 缓存的存储与传输，从而支持"
"更合理的调度策略。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:11
msgid ""
"Prefix Cache has become a standard component in inference systems. With "
"the expanding application scope of large language models (LLMs), the "
"increase in sequence lengths, and the growing adoption of Agent-based "
"applications, the performance benefits of Prefix Cache will become even "
"more significant. The PD Disaggregation in UCM takes Prefix Cache as a "
"foundational assumption and is inherently dependent on its functionality."
msgstr ""
"前缀缓存（Prefix Cache）已成为推理系统中的标准组件。随着大型语言模型"
"（LLM）应用范围的扩大、序列长度的增加以及基于 Agent 的应用程序日益普及，前"
"缀缓存的性能优势将变得更加显著。UCM 中的 PD 分离以前缀缓存为基础假设，并天"
"然地依赖于其功能。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:16
msgid "Transmission Modes of KV Cache Between Prefill and Decode Nodes"
msgstr "Prefill 与 Decode 节点之间 KV 缓存的传输模式"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:18
msgid ""
"There are roughly three transmission modes for KV cache between Prefill "
"(P) and Decode (D) nodes, each with distinct characteristics and "
"application scenarios:"
msgstr ""
"Prefill（P）与 Decode（D）节点之间的 KV 缓存传输模式大致有三种，各自具有不"
"同的特性与应用场景："

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:21
msgid ""
"**Direct Transmission**. KV cache is transmitted directly from the High-"
"Bandwidth Memory (HBM) of the Prefill node to the HBM of the Decode node,"
" typically via a high-speed inter-HBM network or a direct pass-through "
"protocol. This approach is straightforward and efficient, making it "
"highly suitable for scenarios with a 1:1 Prefill-to-Decode ratio (1P1D) "
"and homogeneous P/D nodes. On the scheduling side, coordination is "
"usually required: Prefill and Decode nodes are allocated at the "
"initiation of a request to enable layer-wise KV transmission during the "
"Prefill phase."
msgstr ""
"**直接传输**。KV 缓存直接从 Prefill 节点的高带宽内存（HBM）传输到 Decode 节"
"点的 HBM，通常借助高速 HBM 间网络或直接穿透协议实现。这种方式简单高效，非常"
"适合 Prefill 与 Decode 比例为 1:1（1P1D）且 P/D 节点同构的场景。在调度方面，"
"通常需要协调：在请求发起时为 Prefill 和 Decode 节点分配资源，以便在 Prefill "
"阶段实现逐层 KV 传输。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:26
msgid ""
"**Indirect Transmission via DRAM**. First, the KV cache generated during "
"the Prefill phase is offloaded to Dynamic Random-Access Memory (DRAM). "
"Subsequently, the KV cache is transferred from the Prefill node’s DRAM to"
" the Decode node’s DRAM, and finally loaded from the Decode node’s DRAM "
"into its HBM for inference. In this mode, DRAM acts as a logical cache, "
"which is more compatible with scheduling logic. Critically, HBM is only "
"occupied for the shortest duration in the entire process, effectively "
"reducing HBM resource consumption."
msgstr ""
"**通过 DRAM 间接传输**。首先，在 Prefill 阶段产生的 KV 缓存被卸载到动态随机"
"存取内存（DRAM）。随后，KV 缓存从 Prefill 节点的 DRAM 传输到 Decode 节点的 "
"DRAM，最后从 Decode 节点的 DRAM 加载到其 HBM 中进行推理。在此模式下，DRAM "
"充当逻辑缓存，更便于与调度逻辑兼容。关键的一点是，HBM 在整个过程中被占用的"
"时间最短，从而有效降低了 HBM 资源消耗。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:31
msgid ""
"**Transmission via Unified Storage Pool (Leveraging Prefix Cache "
"Logic)**. This mode fully utilizes Prefix Cache logic, with a unified "
"storage pool serving as the intermediate medium for KV cache "
"transmission. Specifically, the Prefill node offloads KV cache to the "
"storage, while the Decode node performs inference with high hit rates on "
"the Prefix Cache. Compared with the first two modes, this approach is the"
" \"simplest\" in terms of logic and implementation, and achieves the "
"highest degree of decoupling in the entire system, even eliminating the "
"need for a strict distinction between Prefill and Decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"**通过统一存储池传输（利用前缀缓存逻辑）**。该模式充分利用前缀缓存逻辑，以"
"统一存储池作为 KV 缓存传输的中间媒介。具体而言，Prefill 节点将 KV 缓存放至"
"存储，而 Decode 节点以前缀缓存的高命中率进行推理。与前两种模式相比，该方案"
"在逻辑与实现上最为“简单”，并在整个系统中实现了最高程度的解耦，甚至可以消"
"除对 Prefill 与 Decode 节点的严格区分需求。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:43
msgid "Rationale for UCM’s Adoption of the Third Transmission Mode"
msgstr "UCM 选择第三种传输模式的理由"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:45
msgid ""
"The \"simplicity\" and \"decoupling\" of the third mode are sufficient to"
" make it the preferred choice for UCM. In practical implementations, "
"additional advantages have been identified:"
msgstr ""
"第三种模式的“简单”与“解耦”足以使其成为 UCM 的优先选择。在实际实现中，还发现"
"了额外的优势："

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:48
msgid ""
"**Complete Decoupling of Prefill and Decode**: This not only simplifies "
"scheduling logic but also greatly streamlines exception handling."
msgstr ""
"**Prefill 与 Decode 的完全解耦**：这不仅简化了调度逻辑，还大大简化了异常处"
"理。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:50
msgid ""
"**Full Reuse of Prefix Cache Code**: It serves as a \"time-saver\" for "
"developers, as no additional PD Disaggregation-specific logic needs to be"
" added. Consequently, there is no need to address the cumbersome "
"exception handling issues associated with custom logic."
msgstr ""
"**前缀缓存代码的充分复用**：这对开发者来说是一种“省时的做法”，因为无需新增"
"任何 PD 分离特有的逻辑。因此，也无需处理与自定义逻辑相关的繁琐异常处理问"
"题。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:53
msgid ""
"**Unified Storage as Inference Instance State**: This design renders "
"inference instances completely stateless, significantly enhancing the "
"robustness of the entire system."
msgstr ""
"**统一存储作为推理实例状态**：该设计使推理实例完全无状态化，显著增强了整个系"
"统的健壮性。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:55
msgid ""
"**Near-Zero-Cost Heterogeneous Inference**: Due to inherent differences "
"between Prefill and Decode tasks, optimizing cost can be achieved by "
"selecting different graphics processing units (GPUs), precision levels, "
"instance launch methods, and optimization algorithms. While direct inter-"
"GPU transmission becomes more complex in heterogeneous environments, the "
"Disaggregation of KV cache and computation either natively supports such "
"scenarios or only requires the addition of a fully decoupled module. Over"
" time, large inference clusters composed of new and old GPUs with diverse"
" architectures will naturally become a mainstream trend."
msgstr ""
"**接近零成本的异构推理**：由于 Prefill 与 Decode 任务之间存在固有差异，可以"
"通过选择不同的图形处理器（GPU）、精度级别、实例启动方式以及优化算法来实现成"
"本优化。虽然直接跨 GPU 传输在异构环境中变得更加复杂，但 KV 缓存与计算的分离开"
"发要么原生支持此类场景，要么只需添加一个完全解耦的模块。随着时间的推移，由"
"架构各异的新旧 GPU 组成的大型推理集群自然将成为主流趋势。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:63
msgid ""
"In large-scale clusters, the direct transmission mode (Mode 1) requires "
"either a full connection between Prefill and Decode nodes or further "
"division of nodes into smaller groups. This not only increases the "
"complexity of network design and scheduling but also limits the maximum "
"scalable size of the cluster. In contrast, larger and more unified "
"clusters are more conducive to improving overall throughput."
msgstr ""
"在大规模集群中，直接传输模式（模式 1）要求 Prefill 与 Decode 节点之间全互连，"
"或者需要将节点进一步划分为更小的组。这不但增加了网络设计与调度的复杂度，还"
"限制了集群可扩展的最大规模。相比之下，更大且更统一的集群更有利于提升整体吞"
"吐量。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:68
msgid "Enhanced Scheduling Flexibility Enabled by PD Disaggregation"
msgstr "PD 分离带来的更强调度灵活性"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:70
msgid ""
"The flexible decoupling of PD Disaggregation provides greater flexibility"
" for scheduling optimization. Key application scenarios include the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"PD 分离的灵活解耦为调度优化提供了更大的灵活性。主要应用场景包括以下方面："

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:73
msgid "**1. Reducing GPU Compute Idle Time and Maximizing Compute Utilization**"
msgstr "**1. 减少 GPU 计算空闲时间并最大化计算利用率**"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:75
msgid ""
"Under Data Parallelism (DP) in Dynamic Batching, the scheduler merges "
"sequences of different lengths to reduce idle time caused by DP, with "
"task migration performed midway if necessary."
msgstr ""
"在动态批处理（Dynamic Batching）的数据并行（DP）下，调度器会合并不同长度的序"
"列以减少 DP 造成的空闲时间，并在必要时中途迁移任务。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:77
msgid ""
"The scheduler leverages Chunked Prefill to utilize residual compute "
"resources on Decode instances."
msgstr "调度器利用分块预填充（Chunked Prefill）来利用 Decode 实例上的剩余计算资源。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:78
msgid ""
"By default, the scheduler stores KV cache generated from each inference "
"task in a unified external memory. This not only avoids recomputation in "
"case of exceptions but also maximizes system-wide compute utilization "
"through mid-task migration."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，调度器将每次推理任务产生的 KV 缓存存储在统一的外部内存中。这不仅"
"能在出现异常时避免重新计算，还能通过任务中途迁移来最大化全系统的计算利用"
"率。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:81
msgid ""
"The scheduler automatically switches the roles of Prefill and Decode "
"nodes to further exploit underutilized compute resources."
msgstr ""
"调度器自动切换 Prefill 与 Decode 节点的角色，以进一步利用未被充分利用的计算资"
"源。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:83
msgid ""
"When system bandwidth is insufficient, the scheduler triggers additional "
"recomputation to avoid bandwidth bottlenecks."
msgstr ""
"当系统带宽不足时，调度器会触发额外的重新计算，以避免带宽瓶颈。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:84
msgid ""
"The scheduler balances the load across all instances, maximizing compute "
"utilization while improving user experience."
msgstr ""
"调度器在所有实例之间平衡负载，在最大化计算利用率的同时改善用户体验。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:85
msgid ""
"During high-priority task preemption, the scheduler enables seamless "
"migration of existing tasks to new instances."
msgstr ""
"在高优先级任务抢占期间，调度器支持将现有任务无缝迁移到新实例。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:87
msgid "**2. Improving User Experience**"
msgstr "**2. 改善用户体验**"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:89
msgid ""
"The scheduler prevents long sequences from delaying short sequences "
"(which would degrade the experience of short-sequence tasks), thereby "
"improving average Time to First Token (TTFT) and Time per Output Token "
"(TPOT)."
msgstr ""
"调度器防止长序列拖慢短序列（这会降低短序列任务的体验），从而改善平均首 Token "
"时间（TTFT）和每个输出 Token 的时间（TPOT）。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:91
msgid ""
"The scheduler uses simple hashing to map requests from the same user to "
"the same instance as much as possible, increasing the local hit rate of "
"KV cache and reducing both TTFT and bandwidth consumption."
msgstr ""
"调度器使用简单哈希尽可能将同一用户的请求映射到同一实例，从而提高 KV 缓存的局"
"部命中率，并同时降低 TTFT 和带宽消耗。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:94
msgid "**3. Enhancing Exception Handling**"
msgstr "**3. 增强异常处理**"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:96
msgid ""
"The scheduler implements mechanisms such as retries and checkpoint-based "
"resumption to handle exceptions, preventing task errors and failures."
msgstr ""
"调度器实现了重试、基于检查点恢复等机制来处理异常，防止任务出错和失败。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:98
msgid ""
"The scheduler itself is designed with weak state and multi-instance "
"redundancy, eliminating single points of failure and reducing system-"
"level risks."
msgstr ""
"调度器本身采用弱状态和多实例冗余设计，消除了单点故障，并降低了系统级风险。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:101
msgid "Evolution and Future Outlook of PD Disaggregation"
msgstr "PD 分离的演进与未来展望"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:103
msgid ""
"Since its initial proposal, PD Disaggregation has evolved toward greater "
"complexity with the widespread adoption of Deepseek MLA MOE models. This "
"evolution has led to discussions about more granular Disaggregation "
"strategies, such as Activation-Feedforward (AF) Disaggregation and layer-"
"wise Disaggregation. It is undeniable that these more complex approaches "
"can further reduce compute idle time (e.g., idle time caused by DP) and "
"fully exploit compute resources."
msgstr ""
"自最初提出以来，随着 Deepseek MLA MOE 模型的广泛采用，PD 分离已朝着更复杂的方"
"向演进。这一演进引发了关于更细粒度分离策略的讨论，例如 Activation-Feedforward"
"（AF）分离和逐层（layer-wise）分离。不可否认，这些更复杂的方法能够进一步减少"
"计算空闲时间（例如由 DP 引起的空闲时间），并充分利用计算资源。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:108
msgid ""
"However, it is important to recognize that large-model inference is still"
" in its early stages, and PD Disaggregation represents only the starting "
"point for the transition toward large-scale distributed inference "
"deployment. As more application scenarios emerge, there will be an "
"inevitable demand for stricter and stricter Service-Level Agreements "
"(SLAs) and more robust handling of extreme edge cases. Currently, simpler"
" architectural designs (such as the third KV transmission mode adopted by"
" UCM) can provide greater design redundancy for more complex and "
"effective solutions in the future. For example, when implementing "
"checkpoint-based resumption and offline inference, it has been found that"
" these functionalities can be extremely easily integrated into a simple "
"architecture."
msgstr ""
"然而，必须认识到大模型推理仍处于早期阶段，PD 分离仅代表迈向大规模分布式推理"
"部署的起点。随着越来越多应用场景的出现，将不可避免地产生对越来越严格的服务"
"等级协议（SLA）以及更加强健的极端边界情况处理的需求。目前，更简单的架构设计"
"（例如 UCM 所采用的第三种 KV 传输模式）可以为未来更复杂、更有效的方案提供更"
"大的设计冗余。例如，在实现基于检查点的恢复和离线推理时，已发现这些功能可以"
"极其容易地集成到简单的架构中。"

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/index.md:116
msgid ""
"UCM’s understanding of PD Disaggregation remains rooted in the principles"
" of \"**simplicity**\" and \"**decoupling**\", to the extent that it may "
"even sacrifice a certain degree of performance to preserve these core "
"advantages."
msgstr ""
"UCM 对 PD 分离的理解始终植根于“**简单**”与“**解耦**”这两个原则，甚至不惜牺牲"
"一定程度的性能来维护这些核心优势。"

